	<section_number>45.2-572</section_number>
	<catch_line> Violations; penalty</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any person who willfully violates any provision of the Act or any regulation adopted pursuant to the Act, unless otherwise specified in the Act, is guilty of a Class 1 misdemeanor.
	</text>
